---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="CSS Demo — Web Software Technology 2015">

  <div class="article block">
    <p style="color:#999;font-size:0.9rem;"><a href="/webtech/homework">← 作业列表</a> · Unit 3</p>
    <h1>CSS 样式练习 (2016)</h1>

    <style>
      /* 当年用 CSS 写的一个简单但好看的样式 */
      .css-demo .info-box {
        background: #e8f4f8;
        border-left: 4px solid #2aabff;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        margin: 10px 0;
        border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
      }
      .css-demo .info-box h3 {
        margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        color: #2aabff;
      }
      .css-demo .card-grid {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin: 16px 0;
      }
      .css-demo .card-grid > div {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 150px;
        padding: 16px;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        border-radius: 6px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .css-demo .card-grid > div h4 {
        margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        .css-demo .info-box { background: #1e3a3f; }
        .css-demo .card-grid > div { background: #2a2a2a; border-color: #444; }
      }
    </style>

    <div class="css-demo">
      <p>当年用 CSS 写的一些小效果（重新演绎版）：</p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <h3>📌 提示框</h3>
        <p>This is an info box with a blue left border. 2015 CSS done right.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <div><h4>🎨</h4><p>Color 1</p></div>
        <div><h4>🖌️</h4><p>Color 2</p></div>
        <div><h4>📐</h4><p>Layout</p></div>
      </div>

      <p>
        完整的 CSS 样式表见<a href="https://github.com/draplater/personal-site/blob/main/src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro">当前站点源码</a>，
        继承自当时的设计语言：<code>#eee</code> 灰底、白卡片、阴影浮起效果、<code>#2aabff</code> 链接蓝。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
